WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.700
ONE NIGHT LAST OCTOBER, THE CLOUD WENT
DOWN.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.533
MY BED CALLS ITSELF AI. WITHOUT THE
INTERNET, IT COULDN'T LIE FLAT.

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:13.867
SOME BEDS JUST KEPT HEATING.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:18.033
DAYS LATER, THE MAKER ADDED A BACKUP MODE.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:24.167
SOME THINGS SHOULD WORK WITHOUT THE
INTERNET. LYING DOWN WAS ONE OF THEM.
